0.17.0
 - date: 31-10-2026
 - changes:
   - perf: indexes on foreign-key columns (migration 0046); fewer queries on the public quotation view, the versions list and dashboard stats
   - feat: design thumbnails: uploads store a small JPEG next to the image (Pillow); designs, shares and portfolios return thumb_url, and missing thumbnails are built on first request
   - feat: GET /clients/{id}/designs/count returns just the design count for the client tab badge
   - test: RLS idempotency test derives the expected policy count from the policy list

0.16.0
 - date: 31-10-2026
 - changes:
   - feat: every customer message from a shared link is kept (migration 0045: quotation_messages, existing replies carried over); a new answer no longer hides an earlier one
   - feat: GET /clients/{id}/quotation/messages lists them, open questions first; PATCH /quotation-messages/{id} marks a question resolved or opens it again
   - feat: each unresolved question is its own bell item until resolved and cannot be dismissed with "mark as read"; the item opens the client's Details page
0.15.0
 - date: 31-10-2026
 - changes:
   - feat: meetings can be added to the quotation in any order; each records who added it and when (migration 0044: checkpoints.applied_at, applied_by_id) and writes an audit log entry; undo follows the order they were added
   - feat: PATCH /checkpoints/{id}/notes and DELETE /checkpoints/{id} for meetings not yet on the quotation (409 once added)
   - feat: extraction prompt v2: "each/all/every" edits every matching item, ambiguous notes return questions with a suggested sentence, rows with no room are asked about instead of dropped
   - feat: extraction returns questions and agreed_price; an agreed price is stored as the negotiated price and marks the item agreed
   - fix: plural notes now find singular items ("wardrobes" matches "Wardrobe", "tables" matches "table"); the tokenizer dropped an extra letter
   - fix: rows that edit an item deleted since the notes were read are skipped and counted (items_skipped) instead of becoming new rows
   - feat: GET /auth/me reports ai (enabled, monthly_limit, remaining)
   - feat: free-plan businesses get 10 successful meeting-note extractions per calendar month; POST /clients/{id}/checkpoints/extract returns 403 past that; Pro has no cap

