0.13.0
 - date: 29-10-2026
 - changes:
   - feat: GET /dashboard/attention lists customer replies, links expiring within 3 days and quotation rows needing clarity, limited to clients the caller can see
   - feat: GET /shared-links lists every live design, quotation and portfolio link in one place (stopped links excluded, designers see only their clients)
   - feat: quotation lines expose source_hotspot_id so the design editor can open on the hotspot a line came from
   - feat: team members carry client_count (designers only: clients they lead or can access)
   - feat: PUT /portfolio-designs/order sets the portfolio order, used by the designer list and public portfolio links
   - chore: migration 0041 (designs.portfolio_position)
   - feat: only one version per quotation is shared; sharing another version moves the existing customer link to it, so the URL never changes (the old reply and view count reset)
   - feat: new quotation links are readable (client name plus 8 random characters, e.g. mrs-rao-k7m2xq4p); existing links keep working
   - feat: version list reports is_shared and the customer's latest reply (reply_kind, reply_name, reply_message, replied_at)
   - feat: attention items carry a key and a per-user read flag; POST /dashboard/attention/read marks them read (a newer reply is unread again)
   - chore: migration 0042 (attention_reads)
   - feat: AI extraction rejects pasted text or text files over 15,000 characters with 413 before any model call (audio is not limited)

