0.11.0
 - date: 21-10-2026
 - changes:
   - fix: production boot fails fast when production URLs (database, API, frontend, CORS origins) point to localhost
   - fix: storage config has no defaults: STORAGE_BACKEND must be set explicitly; supabase requires URL, service key and bucket
   - fix: all invalid settings are reported in one startup error (single line, no traceback)
   - fix: production requires dev-default settings (DB, JWT secret, admin credentials, URLs, origins, n8n secret) to be set explicitly

